(: Life, health and Orchard Cottage (

    I have a Ph.D in Artificial Intelligence. I am not a rationalist materialist, I am an animist of new materialism. I achieved enlightenment in November 2020 and am free from suffering. Language that frames me as somebody having emotional difficulty is inaccurate, as I do not have a concern, problem, or complaint. I have hEDS, POTS, and orthostatic intolerance. My wife is Ananda, a visionary prophet with genius intelligence who holds an entire map of all spiritual knowledge inside her. My wife and I are living with Sytse in the UK inside an AirBnB in South Somerset, Ilminster, called Orchard Cottage in Lower Chillington. I, Hanjo, have aspergers autism, which means every time I ask a question, I am not containing an emotional charge, a social suggestion that you did something wrong, and I never ask rhetorical questions.

) End Life, health and Orchard Cottage :) With gratitude for this reading
